---
import Cover from '../layouts/Cover.astro';
---

<Cover
  title="Stack Autopsy"
  description="A verdict on the stack you already run. The hook is in the lab; this door is here so the mast is honest."
  page="autopsy"
>
  <div class="cover-doc">
    <section class="cover-lede">
      <h1>Cut the stack <em>open</em>.</h1>
      <p>
        Autopsy is the hook: you mark what you already run, and Noemium passes a
        verdict on that — not a quiz recommendation, not a kit. The engine is
        not on this build. The door stays so the five-entry mast is the real
        product, not a fake.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/map/" style="color: var(--nm-field)">Open the map</a>
        {' '}— the face is live. Come back here when the cut is.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Cover>
